<title>TURKEY: Bosphorus strait closed to traffic due to fog.</title>
<headline>Bosphorus strait closed to traffic due to fog.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's narrow Bosphorus strait was closed to two-way sea traffic due to dense fog, maritime officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They said about 75 vessels were waiting at each end -- the southern Marmara and the northern Black Sea -- of the strait since the early hours. It was unlikely that the waterway would open anytime soon due to persistent fog, they added.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875.</p>
</text>
